  "description": "Dive into Angry Gran Run - a running game that is free to download and simple to install. Completely secure with no threats of malware or viruses. Easily access the latest version at any time.",
  "editor_review": "Prepare for an exhilarating journey with Angry Gran Run! Help Granny escape the Angry Asylum as she sprints through the urban landscape with one aim: liberation! Avoid outrageous obstacles, gather coins, and smash annoying bots in this thrilling endless runner. Give Granny a makeover with wild outfits like a 70s hippie, a superhero, or even a penguin! Discover famous cities like New York and Rome, and keep an eye out for surprises like aliens and dinosaurs. With boosts such as slow motion and invincibility shields, nothing can thwart Granny's great escape. If you enjoy games featuring grandmas, Angry Gran Run is the premier free 3D running experience!",
  "how_to_play": [
    "Sprint, leap, dash, and slide to overcome quirky obstacles.",
    "Gather coins and knock out bots to clear the pathways.",
    "Personalize Granny's appearance with outfits like a 70s hippie, superhero, zombie, and penguin.",
    "Venture into lively cities such as New York and Rome.",
    "Purchase and enhance power-ups like slow motion and invincibility shields."
